{"title": "Invisible (status group)", "pageid": 34954, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Invisible_(status_group)", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>SG_Invisible</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Immunity\"> Immunity </span></h2>\n<p>The following spells/actions grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite\" title=\"Branding Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/45px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Branding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite\" title=\"Branding Smite\">Branding Smite</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/45px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\">Faerie Fire</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_Guardians_(Radiant)\" title=\"Spirit Guardians (Radiant)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/30px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/45px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/60px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spirit Guardians (Radiant)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/30px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_Guardians_(Radiant)\" title=\"Spirit Guardians (Radiant)\">Spirit Guardians (Radiant)</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The following conditions grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Flame_(Condition)\" title=\"Sacred Flame (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacred Flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Branding_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Flame_(Condition)\" title=\"Sacred Flame (Condition)\">Sacred Flame</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_in_SG_Invisible\">List of conditions in SG_Invisible</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Channel_Divinity:_Cloak_of_Shadows\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity:_Cloak_of_Shadows_(Condition)\" title=\"Channel Divinity: Cloak of Shadows (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Channel Divinity: Cloak of Shadows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity:_Cloak_of_Shadows_(Condition)\" title=\"Channel Divinity: Cloak of Shadows (Condition)\">Channel Divinity: Cloak of Shadows</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and imposes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on enemy Attack Rolls.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Invisibility ends early if the invisible entity attacks, casts another spell, takes an action, or takes damage.</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Cloak_of_Shadows\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Shadows_(Condition)\" title=\"Cloak of Shadows (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloak of Shadows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Cloak_of_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Shadows_(Condition)\" title=\"Cloak of Shadows (Condition)\">Cloak of Shadows</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and imposes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on enemy Attack Rolls.</li>\n<li>Attacking, casting spells, or entering a brightly lit area ends this condition.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Greater_Invisibility\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Invisibility (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Invisibility (Condition)\">Greater Invisibility</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Entity has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. Attack Rolls against it have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a></li>\n<li>When interacting with items, casting spells, or attacking, the entity needs to succeed on a <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Check</a> to maintain Invisibility. The Check becomes harder with each successful attempt.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Hide_in_Plain_Sight\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_(Condition)\" title=\"Hide in Plain Sight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hide in Plain Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hide_in_Plain_Sight_(Condition)\" title=\"Hide in Plain Sight (Condition)\">Hide in Plain Sight</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is invisible. It has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. It has a +10 bonus to Stealth Checks.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Invisibility ends early if the invisible entity moves, attacks, casts another spell, takes an action, or takes damage.</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invisible\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and imposes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on enemy Attack Rolls.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Invisibility ends early if the invisible entity attacks, casts another spell, interacts with an object, becomes wet, takes an action or bonus action, or is damaged.</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invisible\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Misty_Escape)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Misty Escape) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Invisible_Misty_Escape_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Misty_Escape_Condition_Icon.w