bp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. It scores a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hit</a> when rolling a 19.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"One_with_the_Shadows\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/One_with_the_Shadows_(Condition)\" title=\"One with the Shadows (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"One with the Shadows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/One_with_the_Shadows_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/One_with_the_Shadows_(Condition)\" title=\"One with the Shadows (Condition)\">One with the Shadows</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is invisible. It has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage